{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45025","headline":"酬李侍御萼题看心道塲赋以眉毛肠心牙等五字 · 皎然","name":"酬李侍御萼题看心道塲赋以眉毛肠心牙等五字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我法从谁悟，心师是贯花。\n三尘观种子，一雨发萌芽。\n定起轮灯缺，宵分印月斜。\n了空如藏史，始肯会禅家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}